import type {Locale} from '../i18n';interface Props{locale?:Locale;}const {locale='zh'}=Astro.props;const en=locale==='en';
---
<footer class="guide-footer"><div class="guide-wrap"><p>{en?'An independent, unofficial nonprofit tourism and educational information guide. Not the park authority, city tourism office or MRT operator.':'獨立、非官方、非營利的旅遊及科普信息指南；不是公園管理方、市府旅遊窗口或捷運營運者。'}</p><section id="privacy"><h2>{en?'Privacy and external services':'隱私與外部服務'}</h2><p>{en?'No Google Analytics, advertising tag, embedded map or device geolocation request is installed by this guide. Images are hosted locally. Opening an external source or map sends you to that provider’s service and privacy policy.':'本站沒有安裝 Google Analytics、廣告標籤、嵌入地圖或請求裝置定位；圖片由本站提供。開啟地圖及資料來源連結後，適用第三方服務的隱私政策。'}</p><p>{en?'The regional weather panel requests Open-Meteo directly from your browser for fixed park-area coordinates. That provider receives connection information such as your IP address; your device location is not requested.':'區域天氣面板由瀏覽器直接向 Open-Meteo 請求固定公園區域座標的預報，供應者會收到 IP 等連線資訊；不要求裝置位置。'}</p><p>{en?'Cloudflare hosts this site and may process connection and security data. Hosting settings may independently inject Cloudflare Web Analytics to measure visits, page views and performance, including URL path, referrer and browser/device information. No site switch to disable this hosting measurement is offered here.':'Cloudflare 提供託管，可能處理連線及安全資料；託管設定也可能獨立加入 Cloudflare Web Analytics，量測造訪、頁面瀏覽及效能，涉及網址路徑、參照來源、瀏覽器及裝置資料。本站沒有提供關閉此託管測量的開關。'} <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a> · <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms">Open-Meteo</a></p><p>{en?'The old offline cache is retired; this guide does not promise offline availability.':'舊離線快取已停止使用；本站不承諾離線可用。'}</p></section><p><a href="/photo-credits/">{en?'Image information':'影像與授權說明'}</a> · <a href="https://khh.travel/zh-tw/attractions/detail/336/">Kaohsiung Travel ↗</a></p></div></footer>
